<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia raises 2.94 mln dinars in bond issue.</title>
<headline>Tunisia raises 2.94 mln dinars in bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it had raised 2.94 million dinars from October's issue of treasury bonds negotiable at the bourse (BTNB).</p>
<p>It said it has sold 10-year bonds worth 2.49 million dinars at 10.5 percent and five-year paper worth 450,000 dinars at 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>BTNB are issued each month on the first Tuesday.  ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
